cff-version: 1.2.0
title: BrotherSBE
message: If you use BrotherSBE in your work, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Khalil
    family-names: Maaouni
repository-code: "https://github.com/khalilmaaouni/BrotherSBE"
version: 1.0.0-rc.28
date-released: 2026-08-08
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin that acts as a senior backend and data engineering
  colleague. It designs systems in the order the work runs (purpose, process,
  architecture, data, expression, then verification), produces a design dossier
  sized by a scored intake, and holds the result to mechanical gates in which
  absent evidence is reported as NO-DATA and is never treated as a pass.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - backend-engineering
  - data-engineering
  - design-review
  - software-verification
license: MIT
